config NFC_FDP_I2C
	tristate "NFC FDP i2c support"
	depends on NFC_FDP && I2C
	help
	  This module adds support for the Intel Fields Peak NFC controller
	  i2c interface.
	  Select this if your platform is using the i2c bus.
